[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_8001","text":"旁白"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_8002","text":"LogOnly_与你相遇之后"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_8003","text":"LogOnly_我们获得了翅膀"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_8004","text":"LogOnly_一双非常巨大的翅膀"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0010","text":"────想要的东西已经到手了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9999","text":"日花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0020","text":"接下来只要重复就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0030","text":"平淡地，重复就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0040","text":"只要重复起承转合就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0050","text":"不然的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0060","text":"不会掉下去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0070","text":"因为\n接下来要去的吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0080","text":"────欧帕卡玛拉德，欧帕卡玛拉德"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0090","text":"穿越天空"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0100","text":"去往无重力的世界"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0110","text":"呐，制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9998","text":"结华"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0120","text":"是什么时候来着，第一次沐浴在聚光灯下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9997","text":"路加"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0130","text":"记得当时觉得特别耀眼"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9996","text":"雾子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0140","text":"但是……从什么时候开始呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0150","text":"不再觉得那么耀眼了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0160","text":"我从相遇的那一刻起就一直是我"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9995","text":"千雪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0170","text":"但其实在一点点改变着"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0180","text":"不知不觉间，对很多事情都习惯了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9994","text":"树里"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0190","text":"活着好难啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9993","text":"灯织"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0200","text":"光跑不行，光休息也不行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9992","text":"冬优子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0210","text":"勉强自己不行，适可而止也不行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9991","text":"凛世。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0220","text":"只有痛苦不行，必须开心才行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9990","text":"智代子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0230","text":"跨越了那么多纠结与挣扎"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0240","text":"呐……我们啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0250","text":"我们到底想把歌声传递给谁呢\n为谁拭去泪水的歌、为了拯救某人的歌────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0260","text":"也许……\n真正想拯救的，其实是自己吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0270","text":"……那是因为咲耶小姐自己深有体会吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0280","text":"我找到了属于自己的天空"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9989","text":"真乃"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0290","text":"也许也学会了振翅的方法"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0300","text":"没有失败的挑战……是不存在的呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0310","text":"只有成功的事才会作为故事留存下来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0320","text":"今天的甘奈，是成不了故事的片段……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0330","text":"……不只是甘奈\n我也有好多好多这样的片段呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9988","text":"雏菜"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0340","text":"无论何时，都想选择幸福的那一边"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0350","text":"但是，艰难的路也不想犹豫"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9987","text":"小糸"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0360","text":"所以，不想把“努力”本身当作目标"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9986","text":"日花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0370","text":"想去到那前方"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9985","text":"美琴"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0380","text":"想在那前方，活下去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9984","text":"声音"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0390","text":"──不去意识的东西，就是“已经足够”\n────去意识的东西，就是“还不够”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0400","text":"“那么，想要什么？”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0410","text":"嗯——是什么呢──？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0420","text":"也许我……还…………我们也许还…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0430","text":"在“成为了偶像”之后\n──────────还没有找到想要的东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0440","text":"快上"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9983","text":"爱依\\n"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0450","text":"去吧…………！！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0460","text":"去吧！！！！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9982","text":"摩美美"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0470","text":"去吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9981","text":"甜花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0480","text":"去吧──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9980","text":"果穗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0490","text":"去吧…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0500","text":"去吧────────────────────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0510","text":"听说乌贼啊，\n以前是外星人哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0520","text":"啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0530","text":"你想看吧\n看它是不是真的像乌贼那样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0017","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0016","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0540","text":"要去了，那个"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0550","text":"穿越天空"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0018","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0560","text":"脱离环绕轨道"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0570","text":"比这里\n还要远得多的地方"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9979","text":"路加"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0580","text":"ti ta ta tik tik shake……\npa dun du da────， ah────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9978","text":"声音"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0590","text":"“好讨厌吧　好丑陋吧　这样的世界”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0600","text":"“即便如此”“为什么”“为了什么”“还要歌唱”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9977","text":"路加"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0610","text":"────……膝上………………\n────────……臂弯之中……………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0620","text":"我的身边一直有歌"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0630","text":"是歌，让我成为了我"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0640","text":"还需要比这更多的答案吗"}]
